r isaacs again  with a messed up face in this episode so  if this character is jake lockley he's  still likely back in the hospital wing  of the duo which is actually incredibly  convenient for both mark and steven  despite the beauty of this place in the  afterlife mark doesn't want to be  trapped in the field of reeds and steven  certainly doesn't want to be a frozen  sand sculpture forever if they need help  getting out of the underworld however  they manage to do it it'll be useful to  have a guy on the outside of the dead  world i'm not going to lie there are a  number of ways that this next episode  will go down but there's one thing i'm  fairly confident about when we finally  formally meet jake lockley his third set  of hands are gonna be a crucial part of  stopping harrow and he might be the key  to rescuing either mark stephen or both  from the afterlife follow me on  instagram and twitter whitneypuppy  follow new rockstars subscribe to new  rockstars for more analysis of  everything you love and thanks for  watching bye  [Music]  you

